flowchart TD
  brief["<b>You</b><br/><i>/ship from your coding agent</i>"]
  plan["<b>Planner</b><br/>builds the execution DAG from the brief"]
  code["<b>Coder stages</b><br/>implemented in parallel, each stage self-tested"]
  gate{"<b>QA gate</b><br/>tests · audits · verdict"}
  fix["<b>Coder fix</b><br/>bounded re-check"]
  reality["<b>Reality-Gate</b><br/>the deterministic checks the brief declared"]
  done(["<b>shipped</b> · <b>complete</b>"])
  held(["<b>reality_gate_failed</b><br/>held for review"])
  sup["<b>Supervisor</b><br/>observes · guides · aborts · re-plans<br/><i>never edits files, never runs commands</i>"]

  brief -->|task brief| plan
  plan -->|dispatch.yaml| code
  code -->|code + verdicts| gate
  gate -->|rejected| fix
  fix -->|re-check| gate
  gate -->|passed| reality
  reality -->|every check passes| done
  reality -->|a check fails| held
  code -.->|progress| sup
  sup -.->|"regression · plateau · repeated failure → re-plan"| plan

